{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1675209600, "end_date": 1675814399, "month_true_total": 144, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:51:37 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "132393049", "author": {"steamid": "76561198389805877", "personaname": "Bubberducky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198389805877/", "num_games_owned": 22, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 502, "last_played": 1772293393, "avatar": "f0b8cf0caacaa9536fef3f5109bc541d6df3bc22"}, "language": "english", "review": "Most fun I had in video game since doom", "timestamp_created": 1675808316, "timestamp_updated": 1675808316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "132391900", "author": {"steamid": "76561198101902510", "personaname": "Hibernape", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Hibernape/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 2328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1431, "last_played": 1768379348, "avatar": "08f62456fab0ccc764a6d39fce91f85028d58e08"}, "language": "english", "review": "There are definitely a lot of things that I do not like about the game, but overall I've had quite a bit of fun with it. \n\nMovement and gunplay feels good, snappy and crisp. Having different \"classes\" is also pretty cool. Decent weapon options.\n\nWhat I'd say is that... this is definitely a GOOD GAME, but it's not casual friendly compared to other games within the genre. As much as I like it, I just think it lacks mass appeal due to how intrinsically difficult, if not downright annoying, some of its core mechanics are (specifically, health attrition, among other things). I can already tell that this game will never be as big as its older siblings but I would absolutely love to be proven wrong. Maybe they're not even trying for that and they're just making a game for their own sake, which in that case, this complaint is invalid. The lack of a solid co-op matchmaking system definitely pegs it down a little, but I assume that's something that will be resolved on its full release.\n\nDon't let any of the sh*t I said above discourage you from trying this game. Overall, I had a great time with it. Looking forward to how it's gonna be like at official release.", "timestamp_created": 1675806624, "timestamp_updated": 1675806624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "132389172", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073338521", "personaname": "Flubdy_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073338521/", "num_games_owned": 149, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 36, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33, "last_played": 1676342994, "avatar": "b95031cb9d48a395ecac95b3a732772cb13fd059"}, "language": "english", "review": "I cannot play the game with my friend???? Devoloper please help me??? Whenever I open the game it opens Epic Games in google chrome???? And I can't go online in the game??? I cannot play with anyone online in the game it just keeps loading???? Please help my best friend spent all of his money for this game for me", "timestamp_created": 1675802590, "timestamp_updated": 1675802590, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0